sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Client (Postman)
    participant B as Book Service
    participant BDB as Book DB (H2)
    participant M as Member Service
    participant MDB as Member DB (H2)

    U->>B: POST /api/loans {memberId, bookId}
    B->>BDB: Find book by bookId
    BDB-->>B: Book or empty
    alt book not found
        B-->>U: 404 Book not found
    else book found
        B->>M: GET /api/members/{memberId}
        M->>MDB: Find member by id
        MDB-->>M: Member or empty
        alt member not found
            M-->>B: 404
            B-->>U: 404 Member not found
        else member found
            M-->>B: 200 Member JSON (with membershipType)
            B->>BDB: Same book already borrowed? Free copy? Active loans count
            BDB-->>B: result
            alt already borrowed, no copy, or loan limit reached
                B-->>U: 409 Conflict
            else borrowing allowed
                B->>BDB: Reduce available copies, save loan
                BDB-->>B: Saved
                B-->>U: 201 Created (loan with due date)
            end
        end
    end
